:: BackgroundCar1

    A few images find their way into your mind, but they are blurry. Almost like they're old memories mostly faded with time.

    You can remember a car, a windy road, and the bright sun in the sky. 
    
    You remember singing songs with people. Maybe three people. Two of them were younger, one was about your age.

    The rest of the memories seem too faded to reclaim. But you do have a strong feeling about it, you feel sorrow. Deep, deep sorrow.

    Tears well in your eyes, but you have no idea why. You dry your eyes and tell $npcs.barden.formal:

    <<button[[I was driving with my family | WakingUp7]]>>
        <<set $plrSpkChoice = "All I remember was driving with three other people. I think they were my family. But that's it.">>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Actually, I remember something completely different | WakingUp6]]>><</button>>

